      "content": "hey, i'm doing some research for a paper on religion and secularism. can u help me out? i need a summary of the main moral arguments that traditionalist theologians use to criticize recent changes in how society defines marriage and family? like i want to really get into the heart of their moral concerns—not just a surface level thing.",
